OL,3,GNEWSADriver who hit 139mph before fatal
OL,4,Acrash jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpirito admitted causing death by
OL,7,Fdangerous driving, causing serious
OL,8,Finjury by dangerous driving, and
OL,9,Fcausing death while driving uninsured,
OL,10,Fand was sentenced to 11 years and nine
OL,11,Fmonths at Maidstone Crown Court.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
